-- Owns a cancellable one-shot timer driven by the monotonic clock.
public define alarm as opaque.
public use "timer" function create giving failable pointer to alarm.
-- Rearming replaces the pending deadline. Zero fires immediately.
public use "timer" function arm(value pointer to alarm, nanoseconds unsigned) giving failable nothing.
-- Returns true after expiry, false after cancellation or before first arm.
public use "timer" function wait(value pointer to alarm) giving failable boolean.
public use "timer" function cancel(value pointer to alarm) giving failable nothing.
-- Wakes a blocked waiter before releasing the timer.
public use "timer" function close(value pointer to alarm) giving failable nothing.
